Module parity.workflow.compensate.

Rule runSaga, produce. It performs io:
  workflow:
    step reserve:
      Return ok of 1.
    compensate:
      Return ok of 10.

    step charge depends on ["reserve"]:
      Return ok of 2.
    compensate:
